ue fusion of urban energy and natural serenity.  \n  \nComprising meticulously designed 1 and 2 BHK apartments, Sanghvi Horizon epitomizes luxury living with its spacious layouts and top-tier finishes. Each residence is thoughtfully crafted to provide residents with a haven of comfort and style, featuring modern kitchens, serene bedrooms, and luxurious bathrooms equipped with high-quality appliances.  \n  \nStrategically located in central Borivali, Sanghvi Horizon ensures easy access to the city's finest amenities, including restaurants, shopping centers, and entertainment hubs. Moreover, its proximity to the lush expanse of the National Park offers residents a refreshing escape from the hustle and bustle of urban life.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Sanghvi Horizon Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![1 BHK Flat in Sanghvi Horizon in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 642258](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9349/BHK_Configuration/ab973fa26dc593585983ca018f4fc959.webp)\n\n1 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n437 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.08 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Sanghvi Horizon in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 642259](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9349/BHK_Configuration/9361793cad98db74620cfd11548ed2f5.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n717 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.78 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Sanghvi Horizon in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 84880](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9349/Floor%20Plan/5dc5839eb98408108d18817c239781e9.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Sanghvi Horizon Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Prime Location.\n* Proximity To Essential.\n* Luxury Living.\n* Spacious Interiors.\n* Modern Amenities.\n* Modern Community.\n\n## Amenities Sanghvi Horizon Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* 24X7 Water Supply\n* Intercom Facility\n* Power Back Up\n* Solar Power\n* Meditation Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Senior Citizens' Walking Track\n* Parking and transportation\n* Clubhouse\n* Multipurpose Hall\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Earthquake-resistant\n* 24/7 Security\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n\n* Community Club\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Open Theatre\n* Nature Walkway\n* Rooftop Graden\n\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Laminated Flush Doors\n\n## Google Map Location of Sanghvi Horizon Borivali East\n\n## Locality Overview of Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Borivali East](/location-review/mumbai/borivali-east-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Borivali East region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Borivali East is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nSanghvi Horizon is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800054086](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800054086)\n\nProject: Sanghvi Horizon\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Sanghvi Horizon Borivali East\n\n---\n\n* St Johns High School\n* Mkvv International Vidyalaya School\n* Everest College\n* Thakur College\n\n* Narendra Hospital\n* Sh