le In Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-east/plots-lpt6l1433)\n/* Sanghvi Horizon\n\n## Sanghvi Horizon\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-east-mumbai-l1433) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: Sanghvi Realty](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-sanghvi-realty-d6986)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Borivali East, Andheri - Dahisar, Mumbai\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 1.09 Cr to 1.77 Cr\\*\n\n![Sanghvi Horizon](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/2094/1785303214_horizon.jpg \"Sanghvi Horizon\")\n\n# Sanghvi Horizon in Borivali East, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Sanghvi Horizon](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/2094/1785303214_horizon.jpg \"Sanghvi Horizon\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 ,2 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **New Launch**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 437 sqft - 710 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 33 Units & 1 Towers\n* Total Project Area: 0.29 Acres\n* Possession: December, 2028\n* Rera: P51800054086\n\n## About\n\n##### Excellent\n\nSanghvi Horizon is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Borivali East locality of Mumbai. Spanning 0.29 Acres, the project features 33 Units in 1 Towers, offering a mix of 1 BHK+1T, to 2 BHK+2T Apartments ranging from 437 sqft to 710 sqft. The address for the project is borivali east, andheri - dahisar, mumbai.\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Sanghvi Horizon are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 BHK+1T units start at 437 sqft. The larger 2 BHK+2T Apartments go up to 710 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Sanghvi Horizon are designed to be accessible, with 1 BHK+1T units priced from 1.09 Cr and 2 BHK+2T Apartments from 1.77 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Sanghvi Realty, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800054086 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2028-12-15, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nSanghvi Horizon is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Swimming Pool, Kids Play Area, Sports Facility, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Maintenance Staff, Power Back-up, Car Parking, Lifts, Club house, Waste Disposal. The security features include for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 0.29 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 33 Units, 1 Towers\n* Sizes: 437 sqft to 710 sqft\n* Project Address: borivali east, andheri - dahisar, mumbai\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Sanghvi Realty\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800054086 Units\n* Possession Start: 2028-12-15\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security:\n* Sports Facilities: Swimming Pool, Kids Play Area, Sports Facility, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Maintenance Staff, Power Back-up, Car Parking, Lifts, Club house, Waste Disposal\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nSanghvi Horizon benefits from its location in Borivali East, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Sanghvi Horizon will begin in 2028-12-15, and the project is RERA registered under P51800054086 Units. Developed by Sanghvi Realty, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_s