e.com/new-launch)\n* [Rentals](https://rental.addressofchoice.com/)\n* [Leasing](https://www.addressofchoice.com/leasing)\n* [Home Loan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/home-loan)\n* [Careers](https://www.addressofchoice.com/career)\n* [Contact Us](https://www.addressofchoice.com/contact-us)\n* [Privacy Policy](https://www.addressofchoice.com/privacy-policy)\n* [Media](https://www.addressofchoice.com/media)\n* [Cultural](https://www.addressofchoice.com/cultural)\n* [Blogs](https://www.addressofchoice.com/blog)\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/sanghvi-horizon/239018/project","title":"Sanghvi Horizon, Borivali East, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹88.64 Lac Onwards | 1, 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Sanghvi Realty developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/sanghvi-realty-9673-9972.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Sanghvi Horizon Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Sanghvi Horizon Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sanghvi-horizon-project-project-large-image1-2497.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Sanghvi Horizon Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sanghvi-horizon-project-apartment-interiors1-9825.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sanghvi Horizon Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sanghvi-horizon-project-apartment-interiors5-3818.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sanghvi Horizon Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sanghvi-horizon-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹88.64 Lac - 3.27 Cr**\n\n₹31,850 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why Invest Through Square Yards?\n\n![Zero brokerage icon](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## Sanghvi Horizon Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Sanghvi Horizon.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  277 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 88.64 Lac** | Check Availability |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  434 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.39 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  584 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.87 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  725 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.32 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1022 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.27 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nSanghvi Horizon's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali East.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Sanghvi Horizon | Borivali East |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 31850 | 35650 |\n| Mar 2026 | 31850 | 34750 |\n| Dec 2025 | 25300 | 32450 |\n| Sep 2025 | 27300 | 30650 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nSanghvi Horizon avg. price is ₹ 31.9 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali East at ₹ 35.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Chandak Greenairy](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-greenairy/152458/project \"Chandak Greenairy\") | ₹ 37,100 |\n| Borivali East | ₹ 35,650 |\n| Current Project **Sanghvi Horizon** | ₹ 31,850 |\n| [Mahindra Vista](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mahindra-vista/243232/project \"Mahindra Vista\") | ₹ 30,700 |\n| [Godrej Bliss Kandivali](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/godrej-bliss-kandivali/224121/project \"Godrej Bliss Kandivali\") | ₹ 29,100 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali East ranges from ₹ 19.1 K to ₹ 1.5 L with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Sanghvi Horizon | In Borivali East |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 31.8 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 46.2 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 98.6 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.5 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Sanghvi Horizon.\n\nA total of 9 residential transactions has been registered so far for Sanghvi Horizon, amounting to ₹ 9 Cr till September 2026.\n\n#### MMRDA Plans Two New Ring Roads to Ease Mumbai Traffic\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is planning two additional ring routes, expanding its proposed network from seven to nine. These new corridors will cover approximately 307 km and will connect existing roads and planned projects across Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.\n\n#### Thane Infrastructure and Development Updates\n\nThe Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel project saw the launch of TBM Arjuna on August 13, 2026, aiming to reduce travel time between Thane and Borivali to approximately 15 minutes. Amazon Data Services is developing a large data center in Ambernath, with an estimated construction cost of ₹3,500 crore, to be ready by 2029\n\n#### Mumbai Boosts Connectivity with Santacruz - Chembur link road Phase 2 & Chembur Metro Station\n\nCM Devendra Fadnavis inaugurated Phase 2 of the Santacruz-Chembur Link Road (SCLR) & the Chembur Metro Station under Metro Line 2B,The SCLR Phase 2 is expected to strengthen the road network between Mumbai's western and eastern suburbs, improving east-west connectivity.\n\n#### Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel Project: Traffic Diversions Announced in Kasarvadavali\n\nTemporary traffic diversions have been implemented in Kasarvadavali for the ongoing work on the ambitious Thane-Borivali twin tunnel project by the Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA). Certain routes will be closed from July 6 to August 5, 2026, to facilitate construction.\n\n#### Mumbai Monorail Services to Resume After Nine-Month Hiatus\n\nMumbai's monorail services are set to resume soon after a nine-month suspension, following approval from the Maharashtra government for safety improvements and fare revisions. MMRDA has proposed increased ticket prices. The monorail, which previously carried around 18,000 passengers daily, will offer improved services after safety upgrades.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n9 Sales Transactions Registered in Sanghvi Horizon From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 15.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 9 | ₹ 9 Cr | ₹ 15,250 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Sanghvi Horizon Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 277 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sanghvi Horizon, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/sanghvi-horizon-apartment-1-bhk-277sqft-20243606123634.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 88.64 Lac\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 434 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sanghvi Horizon, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/sanghvi-horizon-apartment-1-bhk-434sqft-20240202160215.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.39 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 584 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sanghvi Horizon, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/sanghvi-horizon-apartment-2-bhk-584sqft-20243606123641.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.87 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 725 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sanghvi Horizon, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/sanghvi-horizon-apartment-2-bhk-725sqft-20243606123647.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.32 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 3 BHK 1022 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sanghvi Horizon, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 3.27 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Sanghvi Horizon\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Sanghvi Horizon to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Sanghvi Horizon Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sanghvi-horizon-project-apartment-interiors1-9825.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sanghvi Horizon Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyard