.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sanghvi-boulevard-97-prism-project-flagship-opt-d92eae7c-07b8-47e9-89f8-2ee6aab70672.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\n₹ 1.50 Cr to 2.18 Cr\n\n![Sanghvi Morya residential project in Dadar West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sanghvi-morya-project-flagship-opt-9f7306ab-e5a5-45cb-a8c5-96e7d9663a96.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nDadar West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Sanghvi Tirth residential project in Andheri East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sanghvi-tirth-project-flagship-opt-2865d550-9867-4966-923c-5a2eb8b7ad42.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Retail Shop, Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Sanghvi Sapphire residential project in Jogeshwari West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sanghvi-sapphire-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nJogeshwari West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.02 Cr to 2.19 Cr\n\n![Sanghvi Crystal residential project in Goregaon West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sanghvi-crystal-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.61 Cr to 3.38 Cr\n\n![Sanghvi Aria residential project in Santacruz East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sanghvi-aria-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSantacruz East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.75 Cr to 3.00 Cr\n\n![Sanghvi Optima residential project in Dadar West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sanghvi-optima-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nDadar West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.65 Cr to 6.91 Cr\n\n![Sanghvi Palazzo residential project in Andheri West](https://stat